//MOST TEMPLATES MAKING USE OF A STOCK WEAPON UTILIZE THE "UPGRADEABLE" VERSION OF SAID STOCK WEAPON SO THAT THE WEAPONS STATS ARE DISPLAYED TO PLAYERS IN THE FREEZECAM WHEN KILLED. THIS IS NOT REQUIRED FOR NON-STOCK WEAPONS.

